# Treacherous Greed: "a creature that dealt damage this turn" - only this turn. Bear Cub dealt combat damage to Bot2 on turn 3, so on
# turn 5 it has dealt none yet and cannot be sacrificed: Greed is refused (Bot1 can pay, and has no other creature). After Cub attacks
# again on turn 5 and deals its damage, Greed can be cast. Bot2 is at 20 - 2 - 2 - 3 = 13, Bot1 at 23.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Bear Cub
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Treacherous Greed
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bear Cub.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Attack(Bear Cub > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 18
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Hand.Treacherous Greed.Cast
Bot1.Attack(Bear Cub > Bot2)
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 16
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Treacherous Greed.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Treacherous Greed; Bear Cub
Bot2.Life = 13
Bot1.Life = 23
